# Touch & tablet shell packages installed by install-mobile.sh on top of the
# Omarchy desktop layer. The [lenovomarchy] repo holds: the two tablet-built
# omamobile packages, the repacked Omarchy Mobile binaries (omacam,
# omamobile-settings, omamobile-remote, wlrctl — all sha256 + GPG verified by
# image/tools/repack-omamobile) and the tablet's own libcamera (from
# image/camera/libcamera-yt11). The gst/pipewire bits are omacam's camera
# plumbing from Arch Linux ARM.

# --- On-screen keyboard (Wayland input-method-v2 + text-input-v3) ---
squeekboard

# --- Omarchy Mobile touch adaptations & Quickshell plugins (from [lenovomarchy]) ---
omamobile-omarchy
omamobile-shell

# --- Camera: Omarchy Mobile's camera app + its GStreamer/PipeWire plumbing ---
omacam
gst-plugins-good
gst-plugins-ugly
gst-plugin-pipewire
pipewire-libcamera

# --- Omarchy Mobile extras (repacked, verified) ---
omamobile-settings
omamobile-remote
wlrctl
